<title>GERMANY: PRESS DIGEST - Germany - Oct 3.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Germany - Oct 3.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Frankfurter Allgemeine Zeitung, Sueddeutsche Zeitung, Handelsblatt and Die Welt daily newspapers are not published on Thursday because of the Unity Day public holiday.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom +49 228 26097160</p>
